><p>Directory: <code>␀␀␀␀</code></p><div class='nav'>␀␀␀␀<a href='/files/?path=␀␀&amp;page=0'>Parent</a>␀&amp;page=␀␀'>Previous</a>␀␀</div><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Size/type</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>␀␀'>Next</a>␀␀</tbody></table><h2>Upload</h2><form id='upload' data-dir='␀<tr><td colspan='3'>No files on this page.</td></tr>␀␀␀␀'><input id='file' name='file' type='file' required><label><input id='overwrite' type='checkbox'>Replace an existing file</label><button>Upload</button></form>␀<p class='warn'>Replace and delete require explicit confirmation. Directories and recursive deletion are not supported.</p><pre id='status' class='status'></pre>␀␀␀<script nonce='␀'>const token='␀';const status=document.getElementById('status');document.getElementById('upload').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const form=e.currentTarget;const input=document.getElementById('file');if(!input.files.length)return;const replace=document.getElementById('overwrite').checked;const target=(form.dataset.dir==='/'?'':form.dataset.dir)+'/'+input.files[0].name;if(replace&&!confirm('Replace existing file if present?\n'+target))return;const data=new FormData();data.append('file',input.files[0]);const q=new URLSearchParams({dir:form.dataset.dir,overwrite:replace?'1':'0'});status.textContent='Uploading...';try{const r=await fetch('/files/upload?'+q,{method:'POST',headers:{'X-Marauder-CSRF':token},body:data});const t=await r.text();status.textContent=t;if(r.ok)location.reload()}catch(err){status.textContent='Upload failed: '+err}});document.querySelectorAll('.delete').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',async()=>{const path=b.dataset.path;if(!confirm('Delete this file?\n'+path))return;status.textContent='Deleting...';try{const body=new URLSearchParams({path:path,confirm:path});const r=await fetch('/files/delete',{method:'POST',headers:{'X-Marauder-CSRF':token,'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'},body:body});const t=await r.text();status.textContent=t;if(r.ok)location.reload()}catch(err){status.textContent='Delete failed: '+err}}));</script></body></html>␀␀␀Directory page is too large␀text/html; charset=utf-8␀␀␀␀Missing file path␀␀␀Invalid file path␀␀␀Directories cannot be downloaded␀␀␀␀application/octet-stream␀␀␀␀close␀␀␀Connection␀␀/.marauder-system␀␀␀No upload file received␀Upload did not complete␀Could not inspect the existing path␀A directory already uses that name␀␀File exists; enable Replace and confirm␀.BAK␀␀␀␀MB␀␀Could not reserve a backup name␀Could not preserve the existing file␀␀␀␀Replace failed; original file restored␀␀Replace failed; original retained as internal backup␀␀␀␀SD file manager recovery backup: ␀␀␀SD file manager stale backup: ␀␀Could not commit uploaded file␀␀File exists␀File replaced; an internal recovery backup remains␀␀File replaced␀␀␀File uploaded␀␀␀Only one file may be uploaded per request␀␀␀overwrite␀␀␀Upload is too large␀dir␀Missing target directory␀␀␀␀Invalid upload filename␀Invalid target directory␀␀␀␀Target directory not found␀␀Invalid target path␀.TMP␀␀␀␀MU␀␀Could not reserve a temporary file␀␀Could not create temporary file␀File manager stopped during upload␀␀Invalid upload stream␀␀␀SD upload short write: index=␀␀␀ requested=␀ written=␀␀␀ freeMiB=␀␀␀SD write failed or card is full␀SD upload verification failed: expected=␀␀␀␀ actual=␀␀␀␀SD upload verification failed␀␀␀/sd␀Failed to mount SD Card␀Not enough space to begin OTA␀␀␀Update error #: ␀␀␀␀Written only : ␀. Update error #: ␀␀Error Occurred. Error #: ␀␀␀Written : ␀␀ successfully␀␀␀	␀␀␀firmware path is empty␀␀file is not a .bin image␀␀␀␀could not open firmware file␀␀␀␀firmware path is a directory␀␀␀␀file is too small for an app image␀␀no OTA target partition␀firmware image is too large␀could not read firmware headers␀invalid firmware image magic␀␀␀␀invalid firmware segment count␀␀invalid first firmware segment␀␀file is not an ESP application image␀␀␀␀could not identify running firmware␀firmware targets a differen